<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B><U>Overview </U></B></P>  <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The Company is a uranium and
vanadium exploration company. All of the Company&#146;s mineral properties are in either an exploration or development stage and are located in the United States. The Company&#146;s material properties are the: </P>
