effective July&nbsp;6, 2020). Consists of 530 acres, located within Sections 21 and 22, T46N, R17W, 6th P.M. (Approximate Centroid: UTM 12S 697356.17 m E, 4232873.70 m N). </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
