<FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">open-pit.</FONT> The Lease is located within Sections 16, 17, 21, and 22, T46N, R17W, 6 P.M. (Approximate Centroid: UTM 12S 696937.91 m E, 4234331.66 m&nbsp;N). </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
