effective July&nbsp;6, 2020). Consists of 955 acres, located within Sections 18, 19, and 20, T46N, R17W, 6th P.M. (Approximate Centroid: UTM 12S 694578.23 m E, 4233344.81 m N). </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
