Subsequent to December&nbsp;31, 2024 the Company completed an equity financing for gross proceeds of $15,000,000 and amended an existing credit facility to provide an additional US$6,000,000 of capital. Management intends to finance operating costs
and expenditures over the next twelve months with the proceeds from the debt and equity financing. It is expected that the current cash position will be sufficient to fund our needs for the 2025 fiscal year. </P>
