<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">The value of unexercised
<FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap"><FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">&#147;in-the-money</FONT></FONT> options&#148; at the financial <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">year-end</FONT> is the difference between the option exercise price and the market
