<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt; font-family:ARIAL; " ALIGN="justify"><B>C<SMALL>ASH</SMALL> <SMALL>AND</SMALL> C<SMALL>ASH</SMALL> E<SMALL>QUIVALENTS</SMALL> </B></P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:11%; font-size:11pt; font-family:ARIAL" ALIGN="justify">Cash and cash equivalents comprise cash on hand, deposits held on call with banks, highly liquid investments that are readily
convertible into known amount of cash and which are subject to insignificant risk of changes in value. Cash and cash equivalents have a term to maturity of three months or less from the date of acquisition. </P>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
