&#147;Transaction&#148;). Subsequent to the year ended December&nbsp;31, 2024, the Company terminated the proposed plan of arrangement with IsoEnergy (Note 19). </P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
