</B></P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:11pt; font-family:ARIAL" ALIGN="justify">As at December&nbsp;31, 2024, the Company held interests in uranium exploration properties in Utah, Arizona
and New Mexico (&#147;Uranium Properties&#148;); uranium/vanadium properties in Colorado (Highbury and Slick Rock Project) and in Arizona (Artillery Project); and a gold project in Arizona also known as Newsboy Project. </P>
