<TD WIDTH="5%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left"><B>10.</B></TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:14pt; font-family:ARIAL; " ALIGN="justify"><B>A<SMALL>SSET</SMALL> R<SMALL>ETIREMENT</SMALL> O<SMALL>BLIGATIONS</SMALL> </B></P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:11pt; font-family:ARIAL" ALIGN="justify">Laws and regulations concerning environmental protection affect the Company&#146;s exploration and operations. Under current regulations,
the Company is required to meet performance standards to minimize environmental impact from its activities and to perform site restoration and other closure activities. The Company&#146;s provision for future site closure and reclamation costs is
based on known requirements. </P>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P><DIV STYLE="line-height:1.0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:2pt;border-bottom:1px solid #000000">&nbsp;</DIV>
