<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:11pt; font-family:ARIAL"><B>A<SMALL>UTHORIZED</SMALL> <SMALL>SHARE</SMALL> <SMALL>CAPITAL</SMALL> </B></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:11pt; font-family:ARIAL" ALIGN="justify">Unlimited number of common shares without par value. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:11pt; font-family:ARIAL"><B>I<SMALL>SSUED</SMALL> S<SMALL>HARE</SMALL> C<SMALL>APITAL</SMALL> </B></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:11pt; font-family:ARIAL" ALIGN="justify">As at December&nbsp;31, 2024, the Company had 1,034,229,633 (2023 &#150; 994,598,684) issued and fully paid common shares. </P>
