<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:11pt; font-family:ARIAL" ALIGN="justify">During the year ended December&nbsp;31, 2024, the Company issued 4,607,794 common shares upon the exercise of 4,607,794 warrants with an
