proceeds was allocated to warrants using the residual method. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:12pt; font-family:ARIAL" ALIGN="justify"><B>S<SMALL>HARES</SMALL> <SMALL>FOR</SMALL> D<SMALL>EBT</SMALL>
