<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:11pt; font-family:ARIAL" ALIGN="justify">On October&nbsp;6, 2023, the Company issued 1,158,301 common shares with a fair value of $90,000 as a success fee pursuant to the
