<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:11pt; font-family:ARIAL" ALIGN="justify">None granted during the year ended December&nbsp;31, 2024. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:11pt; font-family:ARIAL" ALIGN="justify"><U>During the year ended December</U><U></U><U>&nbsp;31, 2023</U> </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:11pt; font-family:ARIAL" ALIGN="justify">On October&nbsp;6, 2023, the Company granted 36,717,828 incentive stock options to certain directors, officers, employees and consultants
of the Company exercisable at $0.10 per share until October&nbsp;6, 2028. The options vested immediately. The fair value ascribed to the options was determined to be $2,382,195 using the <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">Black-Scholes</FONT> Option
Pricing Model and was included in the statement of comprehensive loss during the year ended December&nbsp;31, 2023. The following assumptions were used: Risk free rate of 4.31%; Expected life of 5 years; Expected volatility of 118% and dividend
yield of $Nil. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:12pt; font-family:ARIAL" ALIGN="justify"><B>R<SMALL>ESERVES</SMALL> </B></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:11pt; font-family:ARIAL" ALIGN="justify"><B>Stock option reserve </B></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:11pt; font-family:ARIAL" ALIGN="justify">The stock option reserve includes items recognized as <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">share-based</FONT> payments expense until such
time that the stock options are exercised, at which time the corresponding amount will be transferred to share capital. If the options expire unexercised, forfeited or are cancelled, the amount recorded is transferred to deficit. During the year
ended December&nbsp;31, 2024, $452,384 (2023 &#150; $1,975,463) was transferred to deficit for options expired unexercised or forfeited. </P>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P><DIV STYLE="line-height:1.0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:2pt;border-bottom:1px solid #000000">&nbsp;</DIV>
<P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:11pt; font-family:ARIAL" ALIGN="center">Page 29 </P>

</DIV></Center>


