<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:11pt; font-family:ARIAL; " ALIGN="justify">On January&nbsp;15, 2025, the Company issued 107,142,857 common shares at $0.14 per share to Uranium Energy Corp.
(&#147;UEC&#148;) pursuant to a subscription agreement entered with UEC on January&nbsp;14, 2025 for gross proceeds of $15,000,000. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
