anniversary of closing (the <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">&#147;One-Year</FONT> Anniversary Payment&#148;) with the option to extend for two subsequent <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">90-day</FONT> periods (the &#147;Extension Options&#148;),
subject to the following condition: </P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:ARIAL; font-size:11pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
