<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:11pt; font-family:ARIAL; " ALIGN="justify">On April 22, 2025, the Company announced that it had submitted both its listing application to the Nasdaq Stock Market
LLC and the accompanying Form 20-F Registration Statement to the Securities Exchange Commission. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
