<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:10%; font-size:11pt; font-family:ARIAL" ALIGN="justify">As at March&nbsp;31, 2025, an amount of $179,997 (December 31, 2024 - $223,489) was owed to related parties. These amounts are
unsecured, <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-interest</FONT> bearing and have no fixed terms of repayment. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:10%; font-size:11pt; font-family:ARIAL" ALIGN="justify">As at March&nbsp;31,
2025, an amount of $4,515 (December 31, 2024 - $4,515) was recorded in prepaid expenses for advances to a company controlled by the Chief Financial Officer of the Company for future consulting fees. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:10%; font-size:11pt; font-family:ARIAL" ALIGN="justify">As at March&nbsp;31, 2025, an amount of $21,571 (December 31, 2024 - $14) was recorded in prepaid expenses for advances to a director of
the Company for future consulting fees and property expenditures. </P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
