<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:11pt; font-family:ARIAL" ALIGN="justify">The Company did not issue any shares for exploration and evaluation assets. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:11pt; font-family:ARIAL" ALIGN="justify"><U>During the three months ended March&nbsp;31, 2024</U> </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:11pt; font-family:ARIAL" ALIGN="justify">On January&nbsp;5, 2024, the Company issued 15,000,000 common shares with a fair value of $1,050,000 pursuant to the acquisition of 175
federal unpatented uranium mining claims, located in San Juan and Grand Counties in Utah (Note 5). </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:12pt; font-family:ARIAL" ALIGN="justify"><B>S<SMALL>HARES</SMALL>
