<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:11pt; font-family:ARIAL" ALIGN="justify">On January&nbsp;18, 2024, the Company issued 674,800 common shares upon exercise of 674,800 warrants with an exercise price of $0.055 for
