with an exercise price of $0.055 for gross proceeds of $102,349. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:11pt; font-family:ARIAL" ALIGN="justify">On February&nbsp;2, 2024, the Company issued 42,150 common shares
upon the exercise of 42,150 warrants with an exercise price of $0.055 for gross proceeds of $2,318. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:12pt; font-family:ARIAL" ALIGN="justify"><B>W<SMALL>ARRANTS</SMALL>
